<title>USA: MWRA says to sell $150 mln bonds on Oct 22.</title>
<headline>MWRA says to sell $150 mln bonds on Oct 22.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Massachussetts Water Resources Authority plans to sell $150 million general revenue bonds through competitive bidding on October 22, an official there said Wednesday.</p>
<p>The sale is set for 1100 EDT.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
